<title>USA: St Paul hogs $1.00-1.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs $1.00-1.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00-1.50 lower compared to last Friday. Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs   57.00</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs   56.50-57.00</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs   55.50-56.50</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs   54.50-55.50</p>
<p>Sows: steady to 1.00 higher. Top 53.00</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-500 lbs   48.50-49.50</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs   51.00</p>
<p>US 2-3     550-700 lbs   52.00-53.00</p>
</text>
